                + "Map<Integer, Integer> areaByRoot = new HashMap<>(); int best = 0; for (int row = 0; row < rows; row++) { for (int col = 0; col < cols; col++) { if (labels[row][col] != 0) { int root = find(parent, labels[row][col]); int area = areaByRoot.getOrDefault(root, 0) + 1; areaByRoot.put(root, area); best = Math.max(best, area); } } } return best; } "
                + "private int find(int[] parent, int label) { return parent[label] == label ? label : (parent[label] = find(parent, parent[label])); } private void union(int[] parent, int[] rank, int first, int second) { parent[find(parent, second)] = find(parent, first); } }";
